Z||000000||Smokin' GT||11-23-2001||03:13 AM||||Hi guys, I'm looking into some drop springs for my 87 GT and I see that sells suspension techniques with like a 1 1/2(?) inch drop for like $165 for both front and rear sets.  And then I'm seeing the eibachs from the fiero store for like $250.  These are the best deals I've seen so far.<P>Basically I'd just like to know your opinion on either of these springs, if you have them even better.  Or if you know of any better quality or priced springs.  Thanks alot.<BR>    <P>------------------<BR>-87 Bright Blue Metallic GT-<BR>          -Joel||||reg||5
